<section class="pg" aria-label="Página 15"><div style="width: 1056px; height: 816px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #283A5F"><div style="position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; right: 0px; height: 12px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr))"><div style="background: #FDBE2F"></div><div style="background: #EF4A37"></div><div style="background: #3DAEE4"></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 48px; right: 48px; top: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px"><div><div style="font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5A6B8C">Guía para adultos</div><h1 style="margin: 0px; font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.1; color: #283A5F">Para leer en familia</h1></div><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Tecnofamilias" style="height: 56px; width: auto; display: block"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 48px; right: 48px; top: 150px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 32px"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; font-family: 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; color: #283A5F"><div><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 8px; font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #283A5F; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #FDBE2F; flex: none"></span>Cómo leer este cuento</h3><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><li>Lean despacio y hagan juntos el gesto de cada superpoder: mano arriba, mano de alto y manos al corazón.</li><li>En cada página pregunten: “¿Tú qué harías?”.</li><li>Repitan la frase hasta que se vuelva un juego: ¡Pregunto, paro y cuento!</li></ul></div><div><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 8px; font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #283A5F; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #EF4A37; flex: none"></span>Preguntas para conversar</h3><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><li>¿Qué haces si un botón brilla mucho?</li><li>¿Cuáles son tus tesoros?</li><li>¿A quién le cuentas si algo te asusta o te hace sentir raro?</li></ul></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; font-family: 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; color: #283A5F"><div><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 8px; font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #283A5F; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #3DAEE4; flex: none"></span>Ideas para la casa</h3><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><li>Usen las pantallas en lugares comunes, donde un adulto pueda ver.</li><li>Acuerden el “relojito” antes de empezar: un temporizador visible ayuda a terminar sin peleas.</li><li>Vean y jueguen juntos, y conversen sobre lo que aparece en la pantalla.</li><li>Carguen tablets y celulares fuera de las habitaciones durante la noche.</li><li>Activen el control parental: Google Family Link (Android), Tiempo en pantalla (iPhone y iPad) y perfiles infantiles en YouTube Kids y plataformas de video.</li><li>Den el ejemplo: los niños copian lo que hacemos con el celular.</li></ul></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; font-family: 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; color: #283A5F"><div><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 8px; font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #283A5F; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #FDBE2F; flex: none"></span>¿Cuánto tiempo?</h3><p style="margin: 0px">La OMS recomienda que los niños de 2 a 4 años no pasen más de 1 hora al día frente a pantallas, y menos es mejor. A cualquier edad, importa tanto qué ven y con quién como cuánto tiempo.</p></div><div><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 8px; font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #283A5F; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #EF4A37; flex: none"></span>La regla de oro</h3><p style="margin: 0px">Si su hijo o hija les cuenta algo que vio o que le escribieron, agradézcanle y mantengan la calma. Si no lo regañamos, seguirá contándonos.</p></div><div><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 8px; font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; color: #283A5F; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #3DAEE4; flex: none"></span>¿Necesitan ayuda? (Colombia)</h3><p style="margin: 0px">Línea 141 del ICBF, gratuita. Reporten contenido de abuso infantil en internet en teprotejo.org.</p></div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 48px; right: 48px; bottom: 36px; border-top: 2px solid #D9DFEA; padding-top: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap"><div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #3E4F72"><span style="display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px"><span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #FDBE2F"></span><span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #EF4A37"></span><span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #3DAEE4"></span></span>¿Vieron los tres círculos de nuestro logo? Amarillo: pregunto. Rojo: paro. Azul: cuento.</div><div style="font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; color: #283A5F">tecnofamilias.com · WhatsApp +57 313 874 3101</div></div></div></section>
<section class="pg" aria-label="Contraportada"><div style="width: 1056px; height: 816px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #E4F4FC; font-family: 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #283A5F"><svg viewBox="0 0 1056 816" width="1056" height="816" style="position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; display: block" role="img" aria-label="Tecnito se despide"><rect x="0" y="0" width="1056" height="816" rx="0" fill="#E4F4FC"></rect><circle cx="528" cy="300" r="210" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.6"></circle><g transform="translate(250 170) scale(1.3 1.3)"><path d="M0,-14 C2,-4 4,-2 14,0 C4,2 2,4 0,14 C-2,4 -4,2 -14,0 C-4,-2 -2,-4 0,-14 Z" fill="#FDBE2F"></path></g><g transform="translate(820 150) scale(1.1 1.1)"><path d="M0,-14 C2,-4 4,-2 14,0 C4,2 2,4 0,14 C-2,4 -4,2 -14,0 C-4,-2 -2,-4 0,-14 Z" fill="#EF4A37"></path></g><g transform="translate(860 330) scale(0.8 0.8)"><path d="M0,-14 C2,-4 4,-2 14,0 C4,2 2,4 0,14 C-2,4 -4,2 -14,0 C-4,-2 -2,-4 0,-14 Z" fill="#3DAEE4"></path></g><g transform="translate(190 360) scale(0.8 0.8)"><path d="M0,-14 C2,-4 4,-2 14,0 C4,2 2,4 0,14 C-2,4 -4,2 -14,0 C-4,-2 -2,-4 0,-14 Z" fill="#EF4A37"></path></g><ellipse cx="528" cy="404" rx="120" ry="14" fill="#000000" opacity="0.06"></ellipse><g class="tap" data-fx="jump"><g transform="translate(528 400) scale(0.85 0.85)"><polyline points="72,-122 120,-150 130,-212" fill="none" stroke="#283A5F" stroke-width="22" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline><polyline points="-72,-122 -98,-80 -104,-38" fill="none" stroke="#283A5F" stroke-width="22" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline><path d="M-32,0 L-32,-70 C-32,-86 -18,-96 0,-96 C18,-96 32,-86 32,-70 L32,0 L80,-14 C82,-42 82,-70 82,-96 C82,-140 46,-158 0,-158 C-46,-158 -82,-140 -82,-96 C-82,-70 -82,-42 -80,-14 Z" fill="#283A5F"></path><g transform="translate(0 -126) scale(0.62 0.62)"><path d="M0,10 C-4,6 -16,0 -16,-7 C-16,-13 -11,-17 -6,-17 C-3,-17 -1,-15 0,-12 C1,-15 3,-17 6,-17 C11,-17 16,-13 16,-7 C16,0 4,6 0,10 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"></path></g><g transform="translate(130 -212) scale(1 1)"><ellipse cx="0" cy="-15" rx="15" ry="16" fill="#3DAEE4"></ellipse><polyline points="-10,-18 -10,-38" fill="none" stroke="#3DAEE4" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline><polyline points="-3.5,-18 -3.5,-44" fill="none" stroke="#3DAEE4" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline><polyline points="3.5,-18 3.5,-43" fill="none" stroke="#3DAEE4" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline><polyline points="10,-18 10,-37" fill="none" stroke="#3DAEE4" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline><polyline points="-12,-12 -24,-24" fill="none" stroke="#3DAEE4" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline></g><circle cx="-104" cy="-38" r="15" fill="#3DAEE4"></circle><circle cx="0" cy="-248" r="72" fill="#3DAEE4"></circle><ellipse cx="-28" cy="-286" rx="20" ry="11" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.35" transform="rotate(-30 -28 -286)"></ellipse><ellipse cx="-25" cy="-254" rx="10" ry="13" fill="#283A5F"></ellipse><circle cx="-22" cy="-259" r="4" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><ellipse cx="25" cy="-254" rx="10" ry="13" fill="#283A5F"></ellipse><circle cx="28" cy="-259" r="4" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><circle cx="-46" cy="-226" r="11" fill="#F28B7A" opacity="0.6"></circle><circle cx="46" cy="-226" r="11" fill="#F28B7A" opacity="0.6"></circle><path d="M-22,-228 Q0,-194 22,-228 Z" fill="#283A5F"></path><ellipse cx="0" cy="-216" rx="8" ry="4.5" fill="#F2705F"></ellipse></g></g></svg><div style="position: absolute; left: 60px; right: 60px; top: 430px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 22px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.05">¡Hasta pronto, tecnoamiguitos!</div><div style="display: flex; gap: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><svg class="tap oc" data-fx="spin" width="52" height="52" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true" style="display: block; flex: none"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="44" fill="#FDBE2F" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5.28"></circle><text x="50" y="68.48" font-family="Fredoka, Nunito, Trebuchet MS, sans-serif" font-size="55" font-weight="700" fill="#283A5F" text-anchor="middle">?</text></svg><span style="font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #283A5F">¡Pregunto!</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><svg class="tap oc" data-fx="spin" width="52" height="52" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true" style="display: block; flex: none"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="44" fill="#EF4A37" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5.28"></circle><rect x="35.04" y="31.52" width="10.56" height="36.96" rx="3.52" fill="#FFFFFF"></rect><rect x="54.4" y="31.52" width="10.56" height="36.96" rx="3.52" fill="#FFFFFF"></rect></svg><span style="font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #283A5F">¡Paro!</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><svg class="tap oc" data-fx="spin" width="52" height="52" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true" style="display: block; flex: none"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="44" fill="#3DAEE4" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5.28"></circle><rect x="27.12" y="32.4" width="45.76" height="29.92" rx="10.56" fill="#FFFFFF"></rect><path d="M36.8,58.8 L31.52,72.88 L48.24,60.56 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><circle cx="39.44" cy="47.36" r="3.52" fill="#283A5F"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="47.36" r="3.52" fill="#283A5F"></circle><circle cx="60.56" cy="47.36" r="3.52" fill="#283A5F"></circle></svg><span style="font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #283A5F">¡Cuento!</span></div></div><div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; color: #3E4F72">Un cuento de Tecnofamilias para cuidarnos dentro y fuera de las pantallas.</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0px; right: 0px; bottom: 0px; height: 96px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 48px; background: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Tecnofamilias" style="height: 60px; width: auto; display: block"><div style="font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; color: #283A5F">tecnofamilias.com</div></div></div></section>
</template>
<script>
(function(){
  var RATIO = 1056/816;
  var SRC = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.getElementById('pages').content.querySelectorAll('.pg'));
  var N = SRC.length;
  var stage = document.getElementById('stage'), book = document.getElementById('book');
  var baseL = document.getElementById('baseL'), baseR = document.getElementById('baseR');
  var prevBtn = document.getElementById('prevBtn'), nextBtn = document.getElementById('nextBtn');
  var labelEl = document.getElementById('label'), fillEl = document.getElementById('fill'), live = document.getElementById('live');
  var hint = document.getElementById('hint'), soundBtn = document.getElementById('soundBtn'), fsBtn = document.getElementById('fsBtn');
  var mode = null, leaves = [], pos = 0, pw = 0, ph = 0, flipCount = 0, soundOn = true, actx = null;

  if (window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)').matches) {
    hint.textContent = 'Haz clic en los personajes y las cosas: ¡se mueven! Para pasar la página, usa las flechas o haz clic en el borde.';
  }
  function durMs(){ var v = getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--dur'); return parseFloat(v) || 900; }

  function face(cls, idx){
    var f = document.createElement('div');
    f.className = 'face ' + cls;
    if (idx !== null) f.setAttribute('data-idx', idx);
    if (idx !== null && idx < N) {
      var w = document.createElement('div'); w.className = 'pg-scale';
      w.appendChild(SRC[idx].cloneNode(true)); f.appendChild(w);
    } else { f.classList.add('blank'); }
    var gtr = document.createElement('div'); gtr.className = 'gutter'; f.appendChild(gtr);
    var ts = document.createElement('div'); ts.className = 'turnshade'; f.appendChild(ts);
    return f;
  }
  function leafCount(){ return mode === 'spread' ? Math.ceil(N/2) : N; }
  function maxPos(){ return mode === 'spread' ? leafCount() : N - 1; }

  function build(newMode){
    leaves.forEach(function(l){ l.remove(); });
    leaves = []; mode = newMode;
    book.classList.toggle('single', mode === 'single');
    var count = leafCount();
    for (var k = 0; k < count; k++){
      var leaf = document.createElement('div'); leaf.className = 'leaf';
      var frontIdx = mode === 'spread' ? 2*k : k;
      var backIdx = mode === 'spread' ? 2*k + 1 : null;
      var fr = face('front', frontIdx), bk = face('back', backIdx);
      var corner = document.createElement('div'); corner.className = 'corner';
      (function(l){
        corner.addEventListener('pointerenter', function(e){ if (e.pointerType === 'mouse' && leaves.indexOf(l) === pos && !l.classList.contains('flipping')) l.classList.add('peek'); });
        corner.addEventListener('pointerleave', function(){ l.classList.remove('peek'); });
      })(leaf);
      fr.appendChild(corner);
      leaf.appendChild(fr); leaf.appendChild(bk);
      book.appendChild(leaf); leaves.push(leaf);
    }
  }

  function layout(){
    var sw = stage.clientWidth - 32, sh = stage.clientHeight - 56;
    if (sw <= 0 || sh <= 0) return;
    var pSpread = Math.min(sw/2, sh*RATIO), pSingle = Math.min(sw, sh*RATIO);
    var want = (pSpread >= 330 && pSpread >= pSingle*0.6) ? 'spread' : 'single';
    book.classList.add('instant');
    if (want !== mode){
      var p = pos;
      if (mode === 'spread' && want === 'single') p = Math.min(N-1, 2*pos);
      else if (mode === 'single' && want === 'spread') p = Math.ceil(pos/2);
      build(want); pos = p;
    }
    pw = Math.floor(mode === 'spread' ? pSpread : pSingle);
    ph = Math.floor(pw / RATIO);
    book.style.setProperty('--s', pw/1056);
    book.style.width = (mode === 'spread' ? 2*pw : pw) + 'px';
    book.style.height = ph + 'px';
    var left = mode === 'spread' ? pw : 0;
    leaves.forEach(function(l){ l.style.left = left+'px'; l.style.width = pw+'px'; l.style.height = ph+'px'; l.classList.remove('flipping','peek'); });
    baseL.style.left = '0px'; baseL.style.width = pw+'px'; baseL.style.height = ph+'px';
    baseR.style.left = left+'px'; baseR.style.width = pw+'px'; baseR.style.height = ph+'px';
    update(true);
    void book.offsetWidth;
    requestAnimationFrame(function(){ book.classList.remove('instant'); });
  }

  function edges(n, dir){
    var out = [];
    for (var i = 1; i <= n; i++) out.push((dir*i*2)+'px '+(i*1.5)+'px 0 '+(i%2 ? '#E7E1D4' : '#FBFAF6'));
    out.push('0 22px 44px -10px var(--book-shadow)');
    out.push('0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08)');
    return out.join(',');
  }

  function setZ(){
    var n = leaves.length;
    leaves.forEach(function(l, k){
      if (l.classList.contains('flipping')) return;
      l.style.zIndex = l.classList.contains('turned') ? (k + 1) : (2*n - k);
    });
  }
  function setVis(){
    leaves.forEach(function(l, k){
      var show;
      if (l.classList.contains('flipping')) show = true;
      else if (mode === 'spread') show = (k >= pos - 2 && k <= pos + 1);
      else show = (k === pos || k === pos + 1);
      l.style.visibility = show ? 'visible' : 'hidden';
      var fr = l.children[0], bk = l.children[1];
      var frontReadable = (k === pos), backReadable = (mode === 'spread' && k === pos - 1);
      fr.setAttribute('aria-hidden', frontReadable ? 'false' : 'true');
      bk.setAttribute('aria-hidden', backReadable ? 'false' : 'true');
    });
  }

  function labelText(){
    if (mode === 'spread'){
      if (pos === 0) return 'Portada';
      if (pos >= leafCount()) return 'Contraportada';
      return 'Páginas ' + (2*pos) + ' y ' + (2*pos + 1);
    }
    if (pos === 0) return 'Portada';
    if (pos === N - 1) return 'Contraportada';
    return 'Página ' + (pos + 1);
  }

  function update(silent){
    leaves.forEach(function(l, k){ l.classList.toggle('turned', k < pos); });
    setZ(); setVis();
    var shift = 0;
    if (mode === 'spread'){
      if (pos === 0) shift = -pw/2; else if (pos >= leafCount()) shift = pw/2;
      var c = leafCount();
